r.av-5qyt8y-7be0a55f006ea40a5b89c5acce3eff71 .hr-inner{\nwidth:50px;\nborder-color:#ed1c24;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='hr av-5qyt8y-7be0a55f006ea40a5b89c5acce3eff71 hr-custom  avia-builder-el-1  el_after_av_heading  el_before_av_one_half  hr-left hr-icon-no'><span class='hr-inner inner-border-av-border-fat'><span class=\"hr-inner-style\"><\/span><\/span><\/div>\n<div class='flex_column_table av-4cjtqq-e7b9f8e0d8c9b3c7dfbd2ac4930407fa sc-av_one_half av-equal-height-column-flextable'><div  class='flex_column av-4cjtqq-e7b9f8e0d8c9b3c7dfbd2ac4930407fa av_one_half  avia-builder-el-2  el_after_av_hr  el_before_av_one_half  first flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top  '     ><section  class='av_textblock_section av-mnhd5abp-e67422425e150725aa640ccb686858a8 '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/BlogPosting\" itemprop=\"blogPost\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" ><p data-start=\"1823\" data-end=\"2063\">The automotive world is gathering in Argentina &#8211; and VENOL MOTOR OIL will be there! This April, we\u2019re heading to Buenos Aires for Automechanika 2026.<\/p>\n<p>We\u2019re excited to announce that the VENOL MOTOR OIL team will be participating in the upcoming Automechanika Buenos Aires 2026 trade fair!<\/p>\n<p>This event is a great opportunity for us to showcase our product range and build new business relationships in the South American market. If you\u2019re planning to attend, feel free to contact us and schedule a meeting with our experts.<\/p>\n<p>When: <strong>08-11 April 2026<br \/>\n<\/strong>Where: B<strong>uenos Aires, Argentina<br \/>\n<\/strong>You can find us in <strong>Hall 1, stand J-19<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Book your meeting today:<\/strong><br \/>\n\ud83d\udcde +48 669 930 600 &#8211; Milena Kotynia<br \/>\n\ud83d\udcde +48 669 460 200 &#8211; Jan Fabisiak<\/p>\n<\/div><\/section><\/div><div class='av-flex-placeholder'><\/div><div  class='flex_column av-246b2q-bda4e88abefd45b98a0ac05